      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sorry old post and didn't see anything when ctrl+f searching through the replies.\n\nDoesn't uncompressed size achieve this? I know it includes more than VRAM since it's overall memory usage but still, it's very likely at least 80% of that size is VRAM. \n\nI personally keep my uncompressed limit at 150, it hides a lot of absurdly **VERY** very poors.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
